--- !u!114 &1875634840
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1875634835}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a2010d4e2b8e8fa4da1115828c49b97e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaskManager
  tasks:
  - title: Welcome to the game.
    description: Press space to start the first step, after completing the current
      task you can switch to the next task by using the space bar
  - title: Selection of adobe
    description: Choosing the right adobe for making ceramics. Finding evenly textured,
      unadulterated adobe
  - title: ' Pulling'
    description: Use the puller to mould the adobe into basic shapes. Click on the
      on/off button and you will enjoy the whole shaping process.
  - title: Coloring
    description: Paint the moulded pottery in the preferred colour. You need to place
      the colour squares onto the porcelain.
  - title: ' Firing'
    description: The colored pottery is fired in a kiln. Click the button to open
      and close the door and click the ON/OFF button to start firing.
  - title: Viewing the artwork
    description: You can enjoy the art by going to the next area to admire the work
      while you wait for it to be fired.
  - title: ' Decorate the bedroom'
    description: Place made ceramic pieces and favorite pieces in the right place
      in your bedroom to add an artistic touch to the room.
  - title: Congrats on completing all the tasks!
    description: You have successfully completed the entire process from making ceramics
      to decorating your bedroom.
  titleText: {fileID: 1473737982}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 1201605558}
